  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math> denote the sum of the numbers obtained when two dice are rolled. If the probability that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>!</mo></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;are coprime, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>!</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;is the sum of numbers of two dice.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>12</mn></math></p><p>Let us check the given condition&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>N</mi></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>!</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;(not possible) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;(not possible) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;(not possible) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;(possible)</p><p>We need to find the probability for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>36</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Now let us find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>.</p><p>Hence, the required answer is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
